          "type": "callout",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "variant": "info",
            "title": "",
            "content": "For vs Since: FOR + período de tempo (for 3 years, for 2 hours). SINCE + ponto específico no tempo (since 2020, since Monday, since I was born). Since geralmente aparece com Present Perfect: \"I have known her since 2015.\""
